                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Segment analysis shows Premium and Mid-Range products dominate the catalogue (403 and 401 of 1,000 products). Average rating is nearly identical across price segments, from 2.85 to 2.98, and every rating segment spans the full $10 to $60 price range, so price does not predict rating. The source data contains no brand field, so price and rating segments are used as stand-ins.' captured-sheet='Brand-wise distribution' id='1'>
