                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Prices range from $10.00 to $59.99, with an average of $35.07 and a fairly even spread across the range. The most expensive product is The Perfect Play ($59.99) and the cheapest is An Abundance of Katherines ($10.00). Price variation is similar across price segments, which stand in for categories because the source data has no product category.' captured-sheet='Price Distribution' id='1' />
